    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410470/extras/966ba14a5928004d607399c842e00f06.poster.avif?t=1739195096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410470/extras/966ba14a5928004d607399c842e00f06.webm?t=1739195096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410470/extras/966ba14a5928004d607399c842e00f06.mp4?t=1739195096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sauna2000: Comedic Sauna Simulator Mystery Horror Game</h2><br><strong>COMING SOON TO EARLY ACCESS!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410470/extras/e9f508f93f168259eaf94c32b3b7459a.webp?t=1739195096\" /></div><br>This is your once-in-a-lifetime possibility to heat a Finnish sauna without actually going to Finland. A simple midsummer plan to heat your sauna and enjoy a cold beer just got a little more complicated! You've crashed your car into a moose, and worse, someone has robbed your summer cottage clean. You'll have to find a way to regain your peace of mind - and while you're at it, help your cottage neighbours have a nice midsummer festival.<br><br>Muhvij\u00e4rvi is a small laketown in the heart of Finland. In Sauna2000 you\u00b4ll get to experience Finnish lifestyle of a small rural peninsula community in the summer of Y2K.<br><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410470/extras/ae35891c672051e75f6a9ac2df4ffb86.poster.avif?t=1739195096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410470/extras/ae35891c672051e75f6a9ac2df4ffb86.webm?t=1739195096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410470/extras/ae35891c672051e75f6a9ac2df4ffb86.mp4?t=1739195096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410470/extras/bf44236b1cc1e1458c98fc0d969af68b.poster.avif?t=1739195096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410470/extras/bf44236b1cc1e1458c98fc0d969af68b.webm?t=1739195096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410470/extras/bf44236b1cc1e1458c98fc0d969af68b.mp4?t=1739195096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>A handcrafted world with over 10 voice-acted and written characters! Get to know them, and even ask them to join you when the sauna is hot! <br>  Many different endings depending on the choices you make. Optional investigative horror narrative. Will you make it over the weekend?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410470/extras/cbc1d622d8153e2bd1854a75eba7ac24.poster.avif?t=1739195096\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410470/extras/cbc1d622d8153e2bd1854a75eba7ac24.webm?t=1739195096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1410470/extras/cbc1d622d8153e2bd1854a75eba7ac24.mp4?t=1739195096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Chop some wood, heat the bathing water, and as the sauna heats discover the true meaning of relaxation.<br><strong>CLASSIC SUMMERFEST ACTIVITIES: </strong> Enjoy sausages and cold drinks at the pier while you enjoy the peaceful setting of beautiful Finnish nature. Shoot things with a BB gun, throw some darts, catch some fish, take cool polaroid photos, or take part in a traditional Finnish boot-throwing competition. You can also move around with your boat if you don\u2019t happen to be out of gas!<br><strong>PS1 ERA INSPIRED GRAPHICS AND UNIQUE SETTING:</strong> Highly stylized world made with passion to video games of older generation. Experience land of the thousand lakes, as you roam the Finnish countryside.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES COMING SOON IN EA:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>FULL VR SUPPORT:</strong> Experience Muhvij\u00e4rvi from your perspective. <br></li><li><strong>EXPANDED WORLD:</strong> Over 30 voice-acted and written characters + Dance Hall + Visiting tourists + Rideable bicycles + Karaoke gameplay + Orienteering competition + Fishing competition <br></li><li><strong>AND MORE:</strong> Free seasonal content expansions planned for the future (more about them in later the updates \ud83d\ude0a).</li></ul>",
